ork","source_label":"江表傳","attribution_marker":"《江表傳》曰：","quoted_work":"江表傳"},"attachment":{"received_paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-deng:line012","received_codepoint":293,"note_ordinal":2,"source_ordinal":3},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-deng","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-059","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-deng"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line068","text":"　　周魴字子魚，吳郡陽羨人也。少好學，舉孝廉，為寧國長，轉在懷安。錢唐大帥彭式等蟻聚為寇，以魴為錢唐侯相，旬月之間，斬式首及其支黨，遷丹楊西部都尉。黃武中。鄱陽大帥彭綺作亂，攻沒屬城，乃以魴為鄱陽太守，與胡綜戮力攻討，遂生禽綺，送詣武昌，加昭義校尉。被命密求山中舊族名帥為北敵所聞知者，令譎挑魏大司馬揚州牧曹休。魴答，恐民帥小丑不足仗任，事或漏洩，不能致休，乞遣親人賫箋七條以誘休。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line068:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"周魴","kind":"person","person_id":"iuc_mqu_3jm","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line068:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"子魚","kind":"person","person_id":"iuc_mqu_3jm","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line068:m0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"彭式","kind":"person","person_id":"di6_rx1_2ru","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line068:m0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"魴","kind":"person","person_id":"iuc_mqu_3jm","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line068:m0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"式","kind":"person","person_id":"di6_rx1_2ru","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line068:m0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"彭綺","kind":"person","person_id":"fmk_v82_0t4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line068:m0094","start":94,"end":95,"surface":"魴","kind":"person","person_id":"iuc_mqu_3jm","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguoz